 "text": "Treasurer | Osage County, KS\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nGovernment\nDepartments\nCommunity\nServices\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nHome\nGovernment\nElected Offices\nTreasurer\nTreasurer\nThe Osage County Treasurer is an elected official. The Treasurer's office is responsible for collecting all real estate and personal property taxes for Osage County. The Treasurer distributes all funds to taxing entities. Additionally, the Treasurer's office services vehicle registrations.\nContact Us\nCommissioners\nCounty Clerk\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nCounty Attorney\nAgendas & Minutes\nEmployment\nNotify Me®\nReport a Concern\nEconomic Development\n-->\nContact Us\nOsage County\n717 Topeka Avenue\nLyndon, KS 66451\nPhone: 785-828-4812\nQuick Links\nOnline Burn Permit\nSchedule an appointment\nEmployee Access\nElected Offices\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHelpful Links\nHome\nContact Us\nSite Map\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nBESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy\nClose ×",
